      "content": "To ensure this proposal resonates with the automated filter while maintaining professional integrity, we should focus on resident-centric benefits. Frame the park's impact around enhancing community well-being and public access to green space for all local inhabitants. Highlighting measurable improvements in public health and social cohesion will demonstrate genuine focus on the individual experience without needing keyword stuffing. This balanced approach will satisfy the systemic requirement while presenting a rigorous planning document.",
